# Fumadocs generated codegen (apps/site)
.source/

# Build-time generated changelog pages (apps/site) — regenerated from
# packages/*/CHANGELOG.md via `pnpm generate:changelog`, never hand-edited.
apps/site/content/docs/changelog/
# Build-time generated tokens reference (apps/site) - regenerated from
# packages/ui/src/styles/tokens.css via `pnpm generate:tokens`, never hand-edited.
apps/site/content/docs/guide/tokens.mdx
# Build-time generated accessibility reference (apps/site) - regenerated from the component
# pages via `pnpm generate:accessibility`, never hand-edited.
apps/site/content/docs/guide/accessibility-reference.mdx
# Build-time generated Markdown for coding assistants (apps/site) - llms.txt, llms-full.txt and a
# .md version of every docs page, regenerated by `pnpm generate:llms`, never hand-edited.
apps/site/public/llms.txt
apps/site/public/llms-full.txt
apps/site/public/docs/

# Generated by `pnpm generate:registry` (the @azmr shadcn registry, served at /r/)
apps/site/public/r/
